{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國家主席習近平國事訪問美國，在白宮出席美國總統特朗普舉行的歡迎儀式，並一同檢閱美軍部隊。此次檢閱儀式，美國海陸空全軍儀仗隊共479人參與，美軍多架隱形戰機飛越白宮上空。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_INEWS.ST25.2300.THU_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026AX0Ac3nPsw1790265110.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_INEWS.ST25.2300.THU_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T16:39:22.706348+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}